function EntryBody19(){ return (<><p style={{fontFamily:"'Crimson Pro',serif",fontSize:17,lineHeight:1.65,color:TEXT_S,marginBottom:12,fontStyle:"italic"}}>Influencing probability fields by modifying vortical interactions intentionally constitutes a physically grounded mechanism for what is colloquially called manifestation.</p><p style={{fontSize:14,lineHeight:1.7,color:TEXT_S,marginBottom:10}}>In the ring model, "probability" is the distribution of vortex interaction outcomes across adjacent ring layers. Modifying vortical interactions through intention means: <strong style={{color:TEXT_P}}>adjusting the phase angle phi_n and rotational parameter theta_n of your local vortex</strong>, which changes the interaction coefficients I_n,k with adjacent rings.</p><QBlock>"Influence probability fields by modifying vortical interactions intentionally."</QBlock><p style={{fontSize:14,color:TEXT_S}}>This is not metaphor -- it is a proposed physical mechanism, awaiting formalization and experimental verification.</p></>); }
